    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n59030" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κοπτός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ή</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>chopped small</i> or <i>pounded</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἰσχάς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Cratin.
					371
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τυρός</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Antiph.
					133.8
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κοπτὴ σησαμίς</span>, a cake of
				<i>pounded</i> sesame, <i><span class="en">
				Artem.
				1.72
			</span></i> codd.; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κοπτή</span> alone in this
			sense, <i><span class="en">
				Sopat.
				17
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>AP</u>
				12.212
			</span></i> (<i><span class="en">
				Strat.
			</span></i>), <i><span class="en">
				<u>POxy.</u>
				113.31
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(ii A. D.)</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Alex.Trall.
				1.15
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κοπτή</span></b> , ἡ, <i>lozenge, pastille</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
				2.103
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Archig.
			</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
				Orib.
				8.46.8
			</span></i>.</div>
